    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρογρᾰφ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>description of a
			country</i> or <i>countries,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.17
			</span></i>; title of works by Varro, Cicero, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Geog.Praef.</u>
				1
			</span></i>: pl., <i>plans</i> or <i>maps</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				685.71
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
