				8.2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>assignment of countries</i> to their tutelary sign or
			planet, <i><span class="en">
